WEBVTT

1
00:00:12,370 --> 00:00:13,270
After Brother Lin

2
00:00:13,850 --> 00:00:15,370
Not resting in the camp in the middle of the night

3
00:00:15,530 --> 00:00:16,570
What are you doing here?

4
00:00:17,930 --> 00:00:24,280
I'm here to take refuge with you. What can you tell me about the camp?

5
00:00:24,280 --> 00:00:25,520
I see it more clearly than Zhao Ya

6
00:00:25,960 --> 00:00:27,080
What's going on?

7
00:00:27,080 --> 00:00:28,360
Or someone has other thoughts

8
00:00:28,360 --> 00:00:30,390
I can tell you there are more

9
00:00:30,830 --> 00:00:32,150
I can also help you recruit people.

10
00:00:32,630 --> 00:00:34,110
I'm already wooing Chen Yao

11
00:00:34,510 --> 00:00:35,670
He is Su Weiwei’s best friend

12
00:00:35,990 --> 00:00:38,030
As long as we can win over him, the others will surrender.

13
00:00:38,030 --> 00:00:41,380
It's only a matter of time before he falters.

14
00:00:42,110 --> 00:00:44,030
All that's missing now is a step

15
00:00:44,510 --> 00:00:48,260
In other words, the opportunity is so today

16
00:00:48,660 --> 00:00:54,920
You brought Chen Yao to make the deal. You got it yourself.

17
00:00:55,240 --> 00:00:57,730
You can't hand it over

18
00:00:58,250 --> 00:00:59,410
It's worthless when I handed it over.

19
00:00:59,770 --> 00:01:01,490
The one you took yourself is called Chen Yao
